<title>JAPAN: ADNOC raises Dec crude price by 90 cts-$1.10.</title>
<headline>ADNOC raises Dec crude price by 90 cts-$1.10.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Abu Dhabi National Oil Co (ADNOC) has raised its official selling prices for crude exports in December by 90 cents to $1.10 per barrel, traders in Japan said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The price of Murban, Umm Shaif and Lower Zakum were all raised by $1.10 per barrel to $24.20, $23.95 and $24.25, respectively, for December.</p>
<p>Upper Zakum was raised by 90 cents to $22.10.</p>
</text>
